WEBVTT

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:18.850
Your Majesty, the preparations for the reconnaissance party to sortie are complete.

00:02:19.470 --> 00:02:20.630
Good job.

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:23.310
You must not fail in your search for the traitors.

00:02:23.740 --> 00:02:25.130
Yes, Ma'am!

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:27.130
Move out!

00:02:30.140 --> 00:02:32.840
Your Majesty, let us go as well.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:36.080
Main force! Move out!

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:49.720
That's Forland's scout unit.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:51.820
The main roads are dangerous.

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:53.810
Put more effort into it!

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:58.700
Hurry up and push! It's not moving at all!

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:01.190
The two of you are completely useless!

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:08.120
There, you can do it if you try, can't you?

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:08.710
Huh?

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.010
Traveling performers?

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:36.860
You can go.

00:03:37.210 --> 00:03:38.470
Thank you very much!

00:03:44.680 --> 00:03:45.710
Sis.

00:03:45.710 --> 00:03:50.230
Yeah, sorry for confining you in such a small space.

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:52.180
Not at all! You saved us.

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:14.470
Sorry about the limited space.

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:18.510
We'll get through this wilderness and will be crossing the border tomorrow.

00:04:18.510 --> 00:04:22.430
We're sorry for getting you involved in our problems.

00:04:22.430 --> 00:04:25.520
What are you saying? You helped us move our cart, didn't you?

00:04:25.980 --> 00:04:28.230
That's the only reason you're helping us?

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:33.110
I'm not someone who serves other people.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:37.510
I owe a debt to people who helped me more than I do to my country.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:42.710
Even though we were helped by you traveling entertainers...

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:45.080
What are we going to do tomorrow?

00:04:45.830 --> 00:04:49.400
If you'd like to know tomorrow's fate, shall I predict it for you?

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:51.420
I'll tell you everything.

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:55.140
I don't believe in fortune-telling.

00:04:56.970 --> 00:04:57.890
Here you go.

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:00.080
T-Thank you.

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:03.460
It's delicious!

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.790
Yuna-chan, what are you saying?

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:10.400
We're androids and have no sense of taste!

00:05:13.060 --> 00:05:14.360
How is it?

00:05:15.380 --> 00:05:18.370
Ah! As I thought, I can't taste anything.

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:20.870
Really?

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:25.440
Anyway, we kidnapped you before.

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:26.710
Why are you being so nice to us?

00:05:27.250 --> 00:05:32.170
Well... the two of you were just following orders, weren't you?

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:36.260
It wasn't your own intent so I think it would be wrong to hate you.

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:43.390
The coup d'état, the kidnapping and all the plans were Doctor Akamashi's, weren't they?

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:46.860
It was the doctor's, but...

00:05:47.530 --> 00:05:49.140
He was used.

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:56.810
The doctor was satisfied with being part of the kingdom of Forland's scientists.

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:01.080
But his research suddenly came to a halt.

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:20.500
At that time, that female magic user ingratiated herself with the doctor.

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:27.820
The doctor was taught the secrets of Lost Technology by her.

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:31.390
We androids like us were then created from various plastics.

00:06:33.720 --> 00:06:37.600
And finally, because of the existence of Teoria, the doctor...

00:06:37.600 --> 00:06:40.790
...decided to execute his coup d'état in Forland.

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:45.840
What happened after that, you already know.

00:06:50.480 --> 00:06:51.640
Doctor...

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:56.550
That woman told the doctor about Teoria as well.

00:06:56.990 --> 00:07:00.590
And then... the doctor was killed...

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:05.910
The doctor and we were both used by that woman!

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.740
What is Teoria?

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:13.880
Master, you were awake?

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:15.150
Princess!

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:18.860
I asked you what Teoria is.

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:22.870
The doctor said it was a wonderful power that would change the world.

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:24.650
I don't know anything more.

00:07:25.140 --> 00:07:28.040
Dominikov, you know something, don't you?

00:07:28.980 --> 00:07:30.250
W-What do you mean?

00:07:31.440 --> 00:07:35.250
There's been something on your mind ever since we went to the castle.

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:38.480
I've been found out, huh?

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.760
Looks like I've got no choice.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:49.220
You! Are you the same as us?

00:07:49.720 --> 00:07:52.070
Our structure is a little different.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:57.050
Pete and I are similar to you, but we aren't androids made completely out of machinery.

00:07:57.640 --> 00:08:00.750
When living organisms and machines are joined...

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:03.800
...a more powerful cyborg-type soldier is created.

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:06.380
Cyborg?

00:08:07.410 --> 00:08:13.440
Both this and that - everything - are all products of the old world's Age of Lost Technology.

00:08:13.440 --> 00:08:18.090
This is the greatest power that it can control.

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:22.050
The source of all of the Lost Technology is Teoria.

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:26.990
The source of Lost Technology...

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:33.980
Mirano, do you know the legends about the beginning of the world?

00:08:34.480 --> 00:08:36.560
Yes, I learned about it.

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:41.730
The gods were fighting and everything on the world was scorched.

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:46.490
The blazing light of the gods spread over the world.

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:48.870
It lasted for one hundred days.

00:08:49.140 --> 00:08:54.790
And then the tears of the gods who lamented over the conflicts became rain and continued pouring down.

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:56.970
The world vanished beneath the water.

00:08:57.570 --> 00:09:03.380
After one hundred days, the water disappeared and life began to flourish on earth again.

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:06.850
The humans who reappeared in this world

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:12.020
called themselves the Shandena and made the world their own.

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:15.910
From that time forward, the Shandena Era began.

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:19.890
It is now the 672nd year of the Shandena Era.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:24.680
Before this, the world was once ruined.

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:30.060
Once upon a time, humans had reached the extremes of art and science.

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:36.140
It wasn't just life. They could control time and space as well and had also reached the peak of civilization.

00:09:37.190 --> 00:09:41.580
The source of all that power was Teoria.

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:47.700
But when Teoria went out of control...

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:50.520
...civilization came to an end.

00:09:51.270 --> 00:09:54.820
The humans killed each other in their conflicts.

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:57.710
Tens of thousands of weapons like us were flying about everywhere.

00:09:57.710 --> 00:10:01.920
Those tens of thousands of powerful weapons rained down upon the earth.

00:10:02.600 --> 00:10:05.320
And so the world was destroyed.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:10.920
The few humans who survived,

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:15.670
sealed away Teoria and their leaders were the only ones left who knew how to break the seal.

00:10:16.420 --> 00:10:20.610
Thus, all of the great ancient technology was forgotten.

00:10:20.610 --> 00:10:20.830
So it became known as Lost Technology.
Thus, all of the great ancient technology was forgotten.

00:10:20.830 --> 00:10:23.630
So it became known as Lost Technology.

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:29.020
But amongst the products of the Lost Technology...

00:10:29.020 --> 00:10:32.890
...a few things passed down from that age to the present.

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:40.020
Weapons like us... Jitterbug, goblins, ogres are the result of biological reconstruction.

00:10:40.520 --> 00:10:43.340
We're all relics of that bygone age.

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:45.060
But...

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:52.860
The arts of the Lost Technology were
bequeathed to a certain country's royal family.

00:10:53.150 --> 00:10:55.410
New creations have been born.

00:10:56.120 --> 00:10:58.080
Isn't that right, Gramps?

00:10:58.800 --> 00:10:59.860
Err...

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.130
Mirano.

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:07.820
I'm sorry that I kept silent about this all this while.

00:11:08.240 --> 00:11:13.140
It was a secret and everything was passed down to the royal family of Forland.

00:11:14.280 --> 00:11:19.130
Teoria was sealed beneath Forland Castle.

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:23.740
The only descendants of those leaders are our royal family.

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:28.010
When it was sealed, they ensured that Teoria could be revived again.

00:11:29.300 --> 00:11:35.930
It was said that if Teoria was awakened, anything could be created if the world wished for it.

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:42.920
One could even transcend time with that technology of the past.

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:48.590
The key was passed to the female descendants of the royal family.

00:11:49.350 --> 00:11:54.130
Princess, you are the only person in the world who is the key.

00:11:54.740 --> 00:11:57.170
So, that's why your brother...

00:11:57.170 --> 00:12:01.640
...wants to use me to wake Teoria?

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:03.470
Yes.

00:12:04.080 --> 00:12:07.670
My brother will definitely capture you.

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:11.390
That is what the daughter of the royal family is born for.

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:14.410
There's no way for us to escape. It's fate.

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:22.950
I'm sorry, Princess. I'm sorry for not telling you.

00:12:23.610 --> 00:12:24.960
It's my fault...

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:32.210
Mirano, don't worry.

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:41.360
Before we exchanged bodies, it was always your burden.

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:45.990
I will now bear that burden; it's nothing.

00:12:48.770 --> 00:12:50.090
Princess.

00:12:56.220 --> 00:12:57.560
Princess?

00:12:58.070 --> 00:12:58.870
It's them.

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:26.980
Seize them.

00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:41.810
If it's true, it looks like I've become an extremely important person.

00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:43.870
This isn't the time for frivolous talk.

00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:51.880
This cart full of people will not be able to escape from horses with single riders.

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:55.260
Target lock on!

00:13:55.260 --> 00:13:57.320
Go!

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:04.050
That's it!

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:07.190
I'm out.

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:09.660
What are you saying? What about missiles?

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:11.920
I fired them all in the castle.

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:14.730
Geez, now it's my turn!

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:17.240
Ana-chan!

00:14:17.600 --> 00:14:21.160
M-My battery has no more energy left...

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:22.750
What are you saying?

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:27.150
I can't help it! The doctor has always been taking care of...

00:14:29.670 --> 00:14:30.960
Doctor!

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:36.210
It can't be helped. We've got no choice but to take care of this, Pete!

00:14:36.210 --> 00:14:37.560
Understood.

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:42.980
Sis, we'll buy time for you to cross the border.

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:45.470
Those guys are from the army! That's rash!

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:48.180
It's time for our trump card.

00:14:49.640 --> 00:14:51.190
Don't die.

00:14:51.190 --> 00:14:53.090
Right, watch this!

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:56.900
Dominikov-san! Pete-san!

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:17.980
What's that?

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:18.970
Those guys...

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:32.660
Are they... Dominikov-san and Pete-san...?

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:33.900
They're scary.

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:36.730
That's the Lost Technology's true power...

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:39.690
They're repulsive.

00:15:41.490 --> 00:15:45.620
You relics of an ancient past... hurry up and die!

00:15:45.620 --> 00:15:48.450
You don't have the right to say that!

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:50.710
What did you say?

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:53.470
Where did that magic come from?

00:15:53.470 --> 00:15:57.210
You're part of the same group as us!

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:58.790
Shut up!

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:16.680
That river is the border, once we cross it...

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.040
It's him.

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:34.460
Princess!

00:16:53.250 --> 00:16:54.530
Fool.

00:16:57.560 --> 00:16:58.500
Not good enough!

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:04.400
Don't move.

00:17:05.770 --> 00:17:09.160
Be obedient and you can save your life.

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:12.970
Because you're the important key to Teoria.

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:16.600
I will use you. The world will be mine!

00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:18.920
Traitor.

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:32.270
Bitch. You tricked me...

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:34.390
A very cunning ploy!

00:17:36.040 --> 00:17:37.620
You should die.

00:17:44.950 --> 00:17:46.950
What is it with those eyes?

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:50.490
Who the hell are you?

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:54.920
I won't give my name to a prince who has betrayed his country!

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:01.180
Why are those eyes...

00:18:01.520 --> 00:18:03.630
Why do I remember them?

00:18:03.940 --> 00:18:06.670
Whose are they? Whose eyes are they?

00:18:07.280 --> 00:18:12.240
Even a lone maid and a bounty hunter who are not related to us...

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:16.100
...risked their lives to protect this country.

00:18:16.100 --> 00:18:19.190
Why is a member of the royal family a traitor?

00:18:20.150 --> 00:18:22.190
You are a shame to our bloodline!

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:37.960
You... can't be...

00:18:53.340 --> 00:18:54.550
Mirano!

00:18:56.700 --> 00:18:58.890
You bastard!!!

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:02.060
Get away from...

00:19:04.990 --> 00:19:07.070
...Mirano!!!

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:19.300
Die!

00:19:23.630 --> 00:19:24.830
Princess.

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:32.380
Are you okay? Are you all right?

00:19:32.380 --> 00:19:33.840
Your wound has re-opened...

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:36.130
Somebody... somebody...

00:19:40.090 --> 00:19:42.690
You're safe... thank goodness.

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:45.120
Mirano.

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:51.630
Prince Kaito!

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:53.990
Withdraw!

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:07.570
I can't move anymore.

00:20:07.570 --> 00:20:09.630
I'm hungry.

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:13.810
I'll handle this! Faris!

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:23.410
What do you think you can do just with that katana?

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.200
Give up.

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:31.650
I will never retreat! I will...

00:20:34.770 --> 00:20:37.140
In that case... die.

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:15.490
Are you awake, Princess?

00:21:16.890 --> 00:21:20.010
Mirano? You aren't injured?

00:21:20.010 --> 00:21:23.450
You're the one who is injured, Princess.

00:21:25.220 --> 00:21:26.690
I had a dream.

00:21:27.220 --> 00:21:28.080
Yes?

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:33.710
I remembered why I became a bounty hunter.

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:43.300
Mirano, you and I are both facing our destinies.

00:21:43.830 --> 00:21:47.190
This is it. We mustn't run away.

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:50.350
Yes.

00:21:57.350 --> 00:22:00.390
I wonder if they're going to be okay?

00:22:00.390 --> 00:22:01.850
Who knows?

00:22:02.200 --> 00:22:05.020
Hey, what did the fortune-telling say?

00:22:05.020 --> 00:22:09.460
Idiot. A fortune depends on how the person perceives it.

00:22:09.910 --> 00:22:10.880
Huh?

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:16.470
It's more interesting if you don't know the future, isn't it?

00:22:25.200 --> 00:22:26.880
Let's return to the castle.

00:22:27.350 --> 00:22:29.520
It's time to end everything.

00:22:29.960 --> 00:22:30.830
Yes.
